# Usage: %man ped    1  173
# man - GroupName, ped - BlockName, 1 - InitModelIndex, 173 - GroupAnimCount
# then there's a list of animations with id and flags(173 lines, ids from 0 to 172).
# To add another animation, increase GroupAnimCount and add animation name at the end of the list.
# For example: 
# %man ped    1  174
# ..................
# walk_civi 173 354
# now you can use id 173 in game.
# DON'T FORGET TO INCREASE GroupAnimCount!

